### valid feedback is stored
PUT /docs/_api/v1/page-feedback/{{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: euid=test-euid

{
  "pageUrl": "/docs/test-page",
  "pageTitle": "Test page",
  "reaction": "thumbsUp",
  "reasons": ["accurate"],
  "reasonSetVersion": 2,
  "comment": " Useful page "
}

### a thumbs down needs a reason
PUT /docs/_api/v1/page-feedback/{{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pageUrl": "/docs/test-page",
  "pageTitle": "Test page",
  "reaction": "thumbsDown",
  "comment": "Missing a required reason"
}

### feedback is deleted
DELETE /docs/_api/v1/page-feedback/{{$guid}}
